# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) are official extension packages that provide specialized quantum computing algorithms and techniques.\n"
msgstr "[Qiskit Addons](https://github.com/Qiskit?q=qiskit-addon) adalah paket ekstensi resmi yang menyediakan algoritma dan teknik komputasi kuantum khusus.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tutorials here {#tutorials-here}"
msgstr "Tutorial di sini {#tutorials-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Addon | Package | Description |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Reduce circuit width by cutting gates, and find cuts automatically |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Addon | Paket | Deskripsi |\n"
"|-------|---------|-------------|\n"
"| **Circuit Cutting** | `qiskit-addon-cutting` | Mengurangi lebar circuit dengan memotong gate, dan menemukan potongan secara otomatis |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's documentation no longer has guides for this addon, and no IBM tutorial covers these two. They come from the addon's GitHub repository and may be outdated. They can be executed directly in your browser using Binder, or on your own Jupyter server.\n"
msgstr "Dokumentasi IBM Quantum tidak lagi punya panduan untuk addon ini, dan tidak ada tutorial IBM yang membahas kedua tutorial ini. Keduanya berasal dari repositori GitHub addon tersebut dan mungkin sudah usang. Keduanya bisa dijalankan langsung di browser kamu memakai Binder, atau di server Jupyter milikmu sendiri.\n"

